Package: ethsign
Title: Ethereum Signing Primitives
Version: 0.0.1
URL: https://dereckscompany.github.io/ethsign,
    https://github.com/dereckscompany/ethsign
BugReports: https://github.com/dereckscompany/ethsign/issues
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Dereck",
           family = "Mezquita",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dereck@mezquita.io",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9307-6762"))
Description: Local Ethereum and EVM wallet signing in pure R: keccak-256
    hashing, secp256k1 ECDSA with Ethereum recovery id and low-s, EIP-712
    typed-data signing, and address derivation. The cryptographic primitives
    needed to authenticate and sign orders on EVM venues such as Hyperliquid
    and Polymarket.
